      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey so i got this huge red bump on my lower back. its pretty big and feels like it's full of liquid under the skin. its kinda throbbing and really sore when i move. do u think i can just use a needle i just sterilized with alcohol to poke it and let the fluid out? i just want the pressure gone so it stops hurting so much.",
